Files in this directory contain material derived from the FreeBSD Project.

Primary upstream sources include:

    src/sys/dev/rge/
    src/sys/dev/mii/

Used for:

    - Realtek hardware register definitions
    - PHY initialization sequences
    - descriptor formats
    - compatibility and device revision handling
    - MII/PHY support definitions

The imported material has been modified for illumos integration,
including:

    - GLDv3 MAC framework conversion
    - illumos DMA and interrupt APIs
    - multiqueue MSI-X support
    - kstat integration
    - FMA topology sensor support
    - illumos build and driver model adaptation

